id: return-to-heritage
name: Return to Heritage
order: 16
description: >
  You have the inherent ability to push away your conscious mind and act on instinct alone.
text: >
  Return to Heritage: You have the inherent ability to push away your conscious mind and act on instinct alone.
  (1)-[Passive]: While in the Feral State, increase your Combat Rolls by 1(bT).
  (2)-[Passive]: Reduce the Stress Test Requirement of the Feral Fist Enhancement Power by 2.
  (3)-[Passive]: You have access to the Feral Fist Enhancement Power.

---

[passive]
# (1)
if (inState("feral")) {
    combatRolls += 1(bT);
}
# Not built: (2), (3) - the Feral Fist Enhancement Power waits on Transformations.
